<title>JAPAN: World Bank launches Philippine peso Eurobond.</title>
<headline>World Bank launches Philippine peso Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank on Thursday launched a 2.75 billion Philippine peso 10.25 percent five-year Eurobond due on April 11, 2002, lead-manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>The Eurobond will be priced in London trading later on Thursday, it said.</p>
<p>The payment date will be on April 11.</p>
</text>
